<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-376-4-ss-2-logic-deontic-1> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Prohibition";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibition of using a false identification to obtain an air passenger ticket.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) A person (the defendant) commits an offence if:  (a) the defendant takes a flight using an air passenger ticket; and  (b) identification information was used (whether by the defendant or another person) to obtain the ticket; and  (c) the information resulted in the identification of a person as a passenger on the flight; and  (d) the information is false in relation to the defendant; and  (e) the flight is a constitutional flight. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The use of a false identification to obtain an air passenger ticket is prohibited.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
